{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t皇崗口岸早上正式開通，不少市民和旅客試用新口岸過關，本台實測大約一分鐘內，經自助通道 「三道閘門」完成通關手續。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n有市民認為通關過程快捷方便，亦有使用口岸的跨境車司機表示，車道查驗過程大致順暢。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T04:38:21.613436+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T04:29:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:58:03.501786+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"1798d41be8b52be31d29741a413499be7d73251ed650bec2f70029edcc40a386","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}